  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1-preview.21\n- Removed the explicit Xamarin.AndroidX.Core PackageReference; GPS binding transitives flow from the binding owner (Xamarin.GooglePlayServices.CloudMessaging).\n\nv1.0.1-preview.20\n- Initial release of the Messaging Android integration package.\n- Implements all four platform contracts (IMessagingRegistrar, IMessagingEventSource, IMessagingPermissionManager, IMessagingTopicSubscriber) over the GMS CloudMessaging transport and FireForNet's native HTTPS topic client, using IFirebaseInstallations FID + FIS token as the single registration identity.\n- KeyStore-encrypted token storage and Custom Tabs-based flows are owned by the Auth packages; this package covers FCM registration, delivery events, permission management, and topic operations.",
